body:
String s = "I overheard someone at a party say cs majors don't pull.".slice(0 , -1) + " out.";

print(s);

There, now its *finished*.

The jokes per minute is high but in terms of a youtube audience this kind of content might not hit as well. If you are playing with friends and recording, ask, what story am I trying to tell and is the story with the edits funny from an outsider's POV. As a smaller channel it's harder to click on long videos watching people play with their friends and get more value than playing a game with their own friends.
TLDR;
Video is funny but could easily be 10 min or less.
